   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1942-12-30">December 30th, 1942</date></dateline>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                  Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>We here at CBS would like you to know how very much we appreciate your cooperation in
               our short wave broadcasts to <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__122" type="place"
                  >Germany</rs>. We feel that when this war is over, your scripts will represent a
               major contribution to great German literature.</p>
            <p>With sincere hope that you will continue your work with us in behalf of a future free
                  <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__122" type="place">Germany</rs>, may we extend to you
               our best wishes for the coming year.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Sincerely,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1086" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">Tony Kraber</hi><lb/>Tony Kraber</rs><lb/>
               Short Wave Program Dept.</signed>
               <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr. Paul Tillich</rs><lb/>
               Theological Seminary<lb/>
               120th Street &amp; Broadway<lb/>
               <rs rend="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York, N. Y.</rs>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
